    8. (jan, 2021; jan, 2021): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN
    9. (ewa, 2021; ewa, 2022): supply 40.00 PLN, demand 80.00 PLN; takes 40.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 40.00 PLN  <- this take
    10. (jan, 2021; jan, 2022): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN
    11. (ewa, 2022; ewa, 2021): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 0.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 0.00 PLN
