    13. (ewa, 2022; ewa, 2022): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 40.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 40.00 PLN
    14. (jan, 2022; jan, 2022): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN
    15. (ewa, 2022; ewa, 2023): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 0.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 0.00 PLN
