    18. (jan, 2023; jan, 2022): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN
    19. (ewa, 2023; ewa, 2023): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 0.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 0.00 PLN
    20. (jan, 2023; jan, 2023): supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN; takes 0.00 PLN; then supply 0.00 PLN, demand 10.00 PLN
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
